We arrive at my building.
Rohan and Priya are with me.
It is still raining heavily outside.
In the corridor, we meet Asha.
Her dog Moti is also with her.
Asha sees me and smiles.
"Happy birthday, Maya!" Asha says affectionately.
"Thank you very much, Asha," I say.
She gives me a small box.
"I bought these sweets for you just today," she says.
"I have brought special pedas for you."
I open the box and am very happy.
There are fresh and delicious pedas in it.
I introduce Asha to my friends.
"Rohan and Priya have also come to celebrate," I say.
"We arrived here by metro," Rohan explains.
"Asha, please come inside with us too," I invite.
Asha smiles and agrees.
Moti happily wags his tail.
We all go inside my flat together.
